@startuml 11-Vfx
' 10층 Presentation — Vfx. 맨 위 표현층. 아무도 이 폴더를 직접 부르지 않는다.
' 아래층이 내놓은 인터페이스(IBattleVfx · ISkillFx)를 구현하고 이벤트(Enemy.Created)를 구독해 붙는다.
' 본게임에서 연출을 갈아 끼울 때 바꾸는 곳이 이 폴더 하나다.
title 10층 Vfx — 클래스 다이어그램

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "아래층이 내놓은 자리" #F5F5F5 {
  interface "IBattleVfx (1)" as IBattleVfx
  class "BattleVfxSink (1)" as BattleVfxSink <<static>>
  interface "ISkillFx (2)" as ISkillFx
  interface "ISkillFxFactory (2)" as ISkillFxFactory
  class "SkillFxSink (2)" as SkillFxSink <<static>>
  class "Enemy.Created (3)" as EnemyCreated <<event>>
}

package "10 Vfx" {
  package "전투 스프라이트" as PSprite {
    class BattleVfx <<static>> {
      + Enabled : bool
      + Cast(ground, radius, style)
      + Impact(ground, height, facing, radius, style)
      + WallBounce(ground, height, normal, radius)
    }
    class "BattleVfx.Sink" as BattleSink
    class VfxRunner <<MonoBehaviour>> {
      + {static} Instance
      + SpawnSprite(clip, ground, height, facing, size, tint)
    }
    class VfxSprite <<MonoBehaviour>> {
      + Play(clip, …)
    }
    class VfxLibrary <<ScriptableObject>> {
      + impact · shock · cast · wall : VfxClip
      + {static} Get()
    }
  }

  package "스킬 전용 연출" as PSkillFx {
    abstract class SkillFx {
      + {static} SizeScale : float
      + {static} Create(data, ctx) : SkillFx
      + {static} HideRenderers(go)
      + OnCast() / Tick(t) / OnHit(i) / Release()
      + HidesProjectile : bool
    }
    class "SkillFx.Factory" as FxFactory
    class "SlashVFX · SpinSlashVFX · FrostFieldVFX\nFlashSlashVFX · ComboSlashVFX · HookChainVFX\nChainBindVFX · MagicMissileVFX · ManaRiftVFX\nShoulderChargeVFX · ManaSpearVFX" as FxComponents <<MonoBehaviour>>
  }

  package "적 · 상태 표시" as PEnemy {
    class EnemyStateTint <<MonoBehaviour>> {
      + BaseColor : Color
      + Body : SpriteRenderer
      + Apply(state : CombatState)
      .. Enemy.Created 구독 → 스스로 부착 ..
    }
    class EnemyStateLabel <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class EliteAura <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class ChargeGauge <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class StatusEffectBar <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class StatusEffectVisuals <<static>> {
      + Label(kind) : string
      + StatusColor(kind) : Color
      + Collect(combat, into) : int
    }
    class CombatStateVisuals <<static>>
  }

  package "조준 · 범위 표시" as PAim {
    abstract class GroundShapeIndicator <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class AttackRangeIndicator
    class SkillRangeIndicator
    class RangeIndicator <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class KnockbackIndicator <<MonoBehaviour>>
  }

  package "화면 가장자리 마커" as PMarker {
    interface IMarkerSource {
      + Collect(into : List<MarkerRequest>)
    }
    class MarkerRequest <<struct>> {
      + ground · height · glyph · color
    }
    class MarkerLayer <<MonoBehaviour>>
    class WorldMarker <<MonoBehaviour>> {
      + Draw(req, drawX)
    }
    class MarkerRules <<static>> {
      + ClampToEdge(…) : float
    }
    class ControlledCharacterArrow <<MonoBehaviour>>
  }
}

BattleSink ..|> IBattleVfx
BattleSink ..> BattleVfx
BattleVfx ..> BattleVfxSink : InstallSink (BeforeSceneLoad · 에디터 로드)
BattleVfx ..> VfxRunner
BattleVfx ..> VfxLibrary
VfxRunner *--> "*" VfxSprite : 풀
VfxRunner ..> RangeIndicator : 함께 생성
VfxRunner ..> KnockbackIndicator : 함께 생성

SkillFx ..|> ISkillFx
FxFactory ..|> ISkillFxFactory
FxFactory ..> SkillFx : Create
SkillFx ..> SkillFxSink : InstallFactory
SkillFx ..> FxComponents : 종류별 하위 연출이 구동

EnemyStateTint ..> EnemyCreated : 구독
StatusEffectBar ..> StatusEffectVisuals
EnemyStateLabel ..> CombatStateVisuals
EliteAura ..> "EliteMarkRules (4)"

GroundShapeIndicator <|-- AttackRangeIndicator
GroundShapeIndicator <|-- SkillRangeIndicator
GroundShapeIndicator ..> "AttackRangePreview (1)" : 그릴 모양
AttackRangeIndicator ..> "IEnemySpecialAction (3)" : 적 특수기 예고
SkillRangeIndicator ..> "SkillState · Installation (2)" : 스킬 · 장판 범위
RangeIndicator ..> "TargetSelector (6)" : 조준 커서
KnockbackIndicator ..> "TargetSelector (6)"
KnockbackIndicator ..> "KnockbackPreview (2)"

MarkerLayer ..> IMarkerSource : 매 프레임 수집
MarkerLayer *--> "*" WorldMarker
ControlledCharacterArrow ..|> IMarkerSource
IMarkerSource ..> MarkerRequest
WorldMarker ..> MarkerRules

' 하위 패키지 순서 (넓은 그림이 PNG 폭 4096 한도에 걸리지 않게)
PSprite -[hidden]down- PSkillFx
PSkillFx -[hidden]down- PEnemy
PEnemy -[hidden]down- PAim
PAim -[hidden]down- PMarker
@enduml
